flowchart TD
    A[Topic or source folder] --> B[Retrieve canon and relevant history]
    B --> C[Researcher: source brief]
    C --> D[Writer: three angles]
    D --> E[Creator selects angle]
    E --> F[Script and independent review]
    F --> G{Script passes?}
    G -- Yes --> H[Generate artwork from approved references]
    G -- Revise within limit --> F
    H --> I[Compose lettering and branding]
    I --> J{Visual and code checks pass?}
    J -- Repair within limit --> K[Repair affected panel or layout]
    K --> I
    J -- Yes --> L[Final copy, transcript, and package]
    L --> M[Deliver and record history]
    M --> N[Manual publication or dry run]
    N --> O[Supplied feedback and metrics]
    O --> B
    G -- Limit reached --> X[Saved draft: needs review]
    J -- Limit reached --> X
